            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://annarosali12.github.io/vibe-coding/recipe/" 
             target="_blank" 
             rel="noopener noreferrer" 
             class="w-full bg-slate-50 hover:bg-orange-500 hover:text-white text-slate-700 font-semibold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group-hover:shadow-md"
             aria-label="Open Macaroni and Cheese Recipe Card in a new tab">
            <span>Get Recipe</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
